    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MAHER & COMPANY SCSI RICS IPAV - Beyond the exterior lies an exceptional 3 bed mid terraced EXTENDED home which has been tastefully upgraded and modernised over the years, finished to a high standard with no expense spared. The extension provides a remarkable amount of open plan living space perfect for families. The property must be viewed in order to fully appreciate the quality of finish and exceptionally convenient location. Situated in this mature and highly sought after estate off the Old Bawn Road, within minutes walk of local shops, public transport, Church, schools, sports clubs and recreational facilities, the link access bridge to Tallaght Village and another to Firhouse via the Dodder Valley walkway all off which facilitate family living. The N81, M50 and N7 are nearby providing ease of access to various routes. VIEWING HIGHLY RECOMMENDED - REGISTER YOUR INTEREST BY EMAIL."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance extended porch to hallway with ceramic tiled flooring, under stairs storage, \r\nGuest wc & whb, fully tiled\r\nLounge: 3.08m x 4.32m wood flooring, chimney breast, fire / stove can be re-instated if so desired, double doors lead to the 2nd reception room\r\n2nd reception / dining room : 3.74m x 4.98m  quality wood flooring, recessed lighting open plan to the kitchen.\r\nKitchen : 3.63m x 4.55m vaulted ceiling with recessed lighting & x3 skylights, superb selection of Cream high gloss units and presses, hob, stainless steel double oven and extractor hood, mosaic tiled splash back, tiled flooring, French doors lead to the deck area.\r\nUPSTAIRS\r\nBathroom : 1.40m x 2.42m  whb with storage - wc -  shower cubicle with Triton T90 xr electric shower - The floor and wall areas are fully tiled\r\nHot press : \r\nBedroom 1 :  2.58m x 3.47m wood flooring, built in wardrobe plus Hot press \r\nBedroom 2 : 4.73m x 2.45m mirrored wardrobes\r\nBedroom 3 : 3.67m x 2.50m wood flooring, built in wardrobe"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "EXTENSION with tiled roof and x3 skylight windows\r\nPVC Double glazed windows\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nGuest wc\r\nModern High Gloss kitchen units \r\nReplaced internal doors, floors, architraves and skirting boards\r\n3 Double bed bedrooms main with mirrored  wardrobes\r\nModern main bathroom fully tiled\r\nWalled garden to the front, paved driveway providing excellent off street car parking\r\nWalled and fenced low maintenance rear garden complete with decking"
      },
